775
00:58:26,180 --> 00:58:31,340
So it's dealing with this.

776
00:58:31,340 --> 00:58:43,360
And the root test is saying that
suppose that when you form this

777
00:58:43,360 --> 00:58:46,360
here, that this has a limit.

778
00:58:46,360 --> 00:58:47,970
Suppose that this n-th root--

779
00:58:50,800 --> 00:58:53,640
suppose that this
here has a limit.

780
00:58:53,640 --> 00:58:56,720
And let's call this limit c.

781
00:58:56,720 --> 00:59:00,080
Suppose that you have this.

782
00:59:00,080 --> 00:59:06,950
Then it has the same three
parts here as in the previous.

783
00:59:15,600 --> 00:59:19,320
And so this is--

784
00:59:19,320 --> 00:59:21,640
so there's three possibilities.

785
00:59:21,640 --> 00:59:25,720
Where c here is less
than 1, then this

786
00:59:25,720 --> 00:59:27,860
implies that the
series is convergent.

787
00:59:34,240 --> 00:59:41,420
Two, c is bigger than 1 implies
