819
01:02:46,220 --> 01:02:50,020
then you have compared
these guys here

820
01:02:50,020 --> 01:02:53,900
with this series here
based on these, at least

821
01:02:53,900 --> 01:02:57,060
from this capital
N and outwards.

822
01:02:57,060 --> 01:03:00,300
And this is a geometric
series because it's

823
01:03:00,300 --> 01:03:03,220
