829
01:03:47,680 --> 01:03:50,280
Because you're comparing
this series here

830
01:03:50,280 --> 01:03:52,200
with the geometric series.

831
01:03:52,200 --> 01:03:53,800
But this here is just--

832
01:03:53,800 --> 01:04:01,520
this just means-- sorry, means
