1047
01:20:13,150 --> 01:20:16,760
And the reason why
we're covering it here

1048
01:20:16,760 --> 01:20:19,840
is that what if the ratio--

1049
01:20:19,840 --> 01:20:22,800
what if these things-- what
if the n-th roots-- so you're

1050
01:20:22,800 --> 01:20:26,240
asking for either the
ratio or the n-th root

1051
01:20:26,240 --> 01:20:28,760
of something to have a limit.

1052
01:20:28,760 --> 01:20:31,520
But what if it
doesn't have a limit?

1053
01:20:31,520 --> 01:20:33,620
And so it's dealing
